Seednaut is an inspection, verification, and extraction utility for
[Seedvault](https://github.com/seedvault-app/seedvault) backups.

Various Android distributions like CalyxOS, LineageOS, /e/OS and
GrapheneOS integrate Seedvault as their main backup mechanism. There
are currently no official tools for inspecting such backups
off-device.  To help fill that gap, Seednaut is a desktop command-line
utility that lets you:
  - Verify that backups are intact
  - Explore backup contents before relying on them
